      "text": "Use \"Settings...\" in the File menu to select audio input and output devices.\n\nThen play an instrument or sing into a microphone.\n\nTHe redDelay patch is using redNoise to modulate a delay, which changes its pitch.\n\nThe tracker is following the input and playing a sawtooth a fifth above.",
